WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:35.803
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Excuse me, please.

2
00:00:37.164 --> 00:00:38.642
Where’s the Click Gallery?

3
00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:40.351
<v><b>Passer-by:</b></v> Sorry, I don’t live here.

4
00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:56.439
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Excuse me. Is the Click Gallery near here?

5
00:00:56.846 --> 00:00:58.428
<v><b>Worker:</b></v> The Click Gallery?

6
00:00:59.114 --> 00:01:03.267
It’s near here, but I don’t know where exactly. Sorry.

7
00:01:03.546 --> 00:01:04.267
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thank you.

8
00:01:12.374 --> 00:01:16.632
Excuse me. Can you tell me the way to the Click Gallery, please?

9
00:01:16.806 --> 00:01:24.053
<v><b>Stranger:</b></v> Yes, of course. Go straight on. Go past the church, and then turn left at the traffic lights.

10
00:01:24.344 --> 00:01:26.007
And it’s at the end of the street.

11
00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:30.148
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Sorry. Could you say that again, please?

12
00:01:30.451 --> 00:01:34.138
<v><b>Stranger:</b></v> Yeah. Go straight on. Go past the church,

13
00:01:34.371 --> 00:01:36.930
then turn left at the traffic lights.

14
00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:39.849
And it’s at the end of the street. You can’t miss it.

15
00:01:40.547 --> 00:01:42.176
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Got it. Thanks.